<br />
Would like to meet new people I feel at home with as well as explore new zones, improve my characters equipment as well as my performance with that character.
<br />
As previously mentioned I play football, but also I am currently at college, studying Business, Economics, Law and ICT. Despite this im EQ addicted, yet I still have time to have two part tiem jobs and hold down a steady relationship with my g/f. I am 17 IRL and am situated in West Yorkshire, England.
<br />

<br />
Thanks for your time
<br />

<br />
Brane Ded
